{"id":"steam-2916700","steam":2916700,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3","summary":"Experience the story from beginning to end in the ultimate culmination of the Attack on Titan game series. The ODM action has been further refined, delivering the most exhilarating and stylish combat the series has ever seen.","about":"■ Experience the story of Attack on Titan from beginning to end\n\r\nThis title is a compilation of the Attack on Titan game series, allowing you to experience the story from its beginning to its conclusion. The game features brand-new story developments in addition to intense new battles against the Nine Titans, who make their first in-game appearance here. Memorable scenes from previous titles have also been rebuilt to offer a fresh experience. \r\n\n\r\n\n■ Omni-directional mobility action—soar through the air and slay Titans\n\r\nThe omni-directional mobility action has evolved, letting you zip through the air with even greater freedom. Titans now move in more varied and unpredictable ways, posing an even deadlier threat. Together, these upgrades deliver intense battles where you read each Titan’s movements on the fly and take them down with flexible, responsive tactics. You can also turn on simple controls, so even players who aren’t confident with action games can pull off maneuvers worthy of a veteran Scout.\r\n\n\r\n\n■ Assemble your own squad and undertake deadly Exterior Missions\n\r\nA new feature, Special Exterior Missions, makes its debut in this title. Together with your squadmates, you will take on life-or-death missions in the vast and perilous world outside the walls. Faced with the overwhelming threat of oncoming Titans, whether you advance or retreat is a decision entrusted to you, the squad leader.\r\n\n\r\n\nPC Features\n\r\n- Support for various gamepads\r\n- Freely customizable mouse and keyboard controls\r\n- 4K Ultra HD resolution support\r\n- Ultrawide monitor support\r\n- Support for various upscaling technologies\r\n- HDR & high refresh rate monitor support\r\n\r\nNote: Availability of these features may vary depending on your hardware configuration.\r\n\r\nImages are from a work in progress and may differ from the final product.\r\n\r\nNotes: Attack on Titan 3/ A.O.T. 3 Digital Deluxe Edition is also available. Please be sure to select the version with your desired content when making your purchase.\r\nTo learn more, please visit the official Attack on Titan 3/ A.O.T. 3 website.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/b7fac268df18e16d8281f6abf487657451c6cb8b/library_capsule.jpg?t=1792542505","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/4f8050e28af7bfa290b187dda2ecf776db7b6c85/header.jpg?t=1792542505","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/2297cf7eda90fa5e3d1669f5d271034d477fee4c/library_hero.jpg?t=1792542505","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/4f8050e28af7bfa290b187dda2ecf776db7b6c85/header.jpg?t=1792542505","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/f8835c2deba2bd817dea89ae8c3823c27f0a24d4/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1792542505","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/871933580aa87f0a97a389df3f81d9cd4b734fa2/ss_871933580aa87f0a97a389df3f81d9cd4b734fa2.600x338.jpg?t=1792542505","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/871933580aa87f0a97a389df3f81d9cd4b734fa2/ss_871933580aa87f0a97a389df3f81d9cd4b734fa2.jpg?t=1792542505"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/73f0e21e129840eadfd5011743d79f146d6a0b77/ss_73f0e21e129840eadfd5011743d79f146d6a0b77.600x338.jpg?t=1792542505","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916700/73f0e21e129840eadfd5011743d79f146d6a0b77/ss